                "text": "We can\u2019t keep our communities healthy or our state moving forward if we don\u2019t address the healthcare crisis we\u2019re in.\n\u00a0\nCommunity health centers like Zufall Health in New Jersey are feeling the pressure, not just from Medicaid cuts earlier this year, but from what skyrocketing ACA costs would mean for our state and the people they serve.",
