                "text": "Rent or groceries. Medicine or gas. Education or healthcare.\n\nRight now, families face an impossible choice because of the healthcare crisis that Trump and Congressional Republicans have created.\n\nIt\u2019s way past time for them to come back to work and end this shutdown. https://t.co/R5xm3iPWiL",
